                        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Drop a Soli app in <code class="text-emerald-300 text-xs bg-emerald-500/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">sites/</code> and it's live. Auto-discovery, port allocation, health checks, and zero-downtime blue-green deployments. Domains get TLS certificates automatically.</p>
