                <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4">Self-signed certs for dev, Let's Encrypt for production. Per-domain SNI routing with auto-renewal.</p>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-300">
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>ACME HTTP-01 Challenges</li>
