                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Config changes applied instantly without restarting. Send SIGUSR1, use the Admin API, or let the file watcher do it automatically.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Lua Scripting -->
            <div class="group relative rounded-3xl bg-gray-900 border border-white/10 p-8 hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300 " style="transition-delay: 400ms;">
